IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. Q3-SIMPLE-INTEREST.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-PRINCIPAL PIC 9(8)V99.
01 WS-RATE PIC 99V99.
01 WS-YEARS PIC 999.
01 WS-INTEREST PIC 9(10)V99.
01 WS-TOTAL PIC 9(10)V99.
01 WS-INT-OUT PIC Z(9)9.99.
01 WS-TOTAL-OUT PIC Z(9)9.99.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "Enter Principal Amount:"
    ACCEPT WS-PRINCIPAL
    DISPLAY "Enter Rate of Interest:"
    ACCEPT WS-RATE
    DISPLAY "Enter Number of Years:"
    ACCEPT WS-YEARS
    IF WS-PRINCIPAL < 0 OR WS-RATE < 0 OR WS-YEARS < 0
        DISPLAY "INVALID INPUT"
    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-INTEREST = WS-PRINCIPAL * WS-RATE * WS-YEARS / 100
        COMPUTE WS-TOTAL = WS-PRINCIPAL + WS-INTEREST
        MOVE WS-INTEREST TO WS-INT-OUT
        MOVE WS-TOTAL TO WS-TOTAL-OUT
        DISPLAY "Interest: " WS-INT-OUT
        DISPLAY "Total: " WS-TOTAL-OUT
    END-IF
    STOP RUN.
